WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.160
Can you count 7 toys and get 8?

00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:06.180
Easily, if you count one toy twice.

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:11.800
The trick: touch each thing once, and say one number for each touch.

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:15.630
Point, say, move on.

00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:18.430
The last number you say is how many there are.

00:00:18.430 --> 00:00:21.013
Here, that is 7.
